Package: descs
Title: Generate data frames for APA style descriptive statistics tables.
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Lucy", "Waldren", , "lhw38@bath.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package creates a data.frame for an APA formatted descriptive statistics table, including M, SD, and half-stacked correlation table (r, p, 95%CI).
